    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rvx4](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rvx4) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Dec 19 2025 136 km NE of Labasa, Fiji. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.6018 longitude -179.6913. It impacted 42 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
